---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<>
<section class="w-full col-center z-0 gap-4 mt-20">
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-2 md:gap-3.5 xl:gap-5 max-w-6xl mx-auto mt-8">
        <div class="w-full col-center gap-3 md:gap-2">
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center">
                Why Us ?
            </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-8 mt-12">
            <div class="w-1/2 flex flex-col items-start justify-start gap-5">
                <div class="px-8 py-4 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md gap-4 hover:bg-(--primary-clr-lit) group transform transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer">
                    <h6 class="text-(--primary-clr-lit) text-lg lg:text-2xl font-bold capitalize group-hover:text-white">
                        our proven track record:
                    </h6>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 group-hover:text-white">
                        Our previous track record in managing warehousing assets and our current pipeline itself testify our credentials as a serious end to end warehouse developer and managers.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="px-8 py-4 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md gap-4 hover:bg-(--primary-clr-lit) group transform transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer">
                    <h6 class="text-(--primary-clr-lit) text-lg lg:text-2xl font-bold capitalize group-hover:text-white">
                        transformational team:
                    </h6>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 group-hover:text-white">
                        A company is as good as the synergy within its team. We are proud to say that our agile, focused and relentless team is working round the clock towards.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="px-8 py-4 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md gap-4 hover:bg-(--primary-clr-lit) group transform transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer">
                    <h6 class="text-(--primary-clr-lit) text-lg lg:text-2xl font-bold capitalize group-hover:text-white">
                        importance of quality:
                    </h6>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 group-hover:text-white">
                        Quality is our benchmark number one. With a process-driven approach, we adhere to global standards. Our focus on quality delivery and management sets us apart.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="px-8 py-4 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md gap-4 hover:bg-(--primary-clr-lit) group transform transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer">
                    <h6 class="text-(--primary-clr-lit) text-lg lg:text-2xl font-bold capitalize group-hover:text-white">
                        making a difference:
                    </h6>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 group-hover:text-white">
                        With the vision of our founders, with a very capable and prompt execution team and with a supportive and large client base, we are well poised to make a difference in Indian Warehousing industry.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-1/2 flex flex-col items-start justify-start px-12">
                <div class="relative after:absolute after:w-[calc(100%+16px)] after:h-[calc(100%+32px)] after:top-0 after:left-0 after:bg-(--primary-clr-lit) after:-z-10 after:-translate-y-4 after:rounded-tl-[25%] after:rounded-br-[25%]"> 
                    <Image src="/images/upload/why-us.webp" alt="why as" width={510} height={650} class="w-full" />
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-2 md:gap-3.5 xl:gap-5 max-w-6xl mx-auto my-16">
        <div class="w-full col-center gap-3 md:gap-2">
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center fade-in-up">
                Our Promise
            </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full fade-in-up">
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-end">
                <Image src="/icons/arrow-design.webp" alt="arrow-icon" width={120} height={90} class="w-24" />
            </div>
            <div class="w-full mx-auto my-1.5">
                <div class="col-center py-0.5 px-6 gap-3.5">
                    <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500 w-full text-justify md:text-center md:px-24 xl:px-32">
                        We go beyond building warehouses—we build long-term partnerships. By combining expertise, integrity, and innovation, we deliver logistics solutions that support your business today and scale with you tomorrow.
                    </p>
                    <a href="#" class="font-bold px-5 py-1.5 rounded-md border border-[#F4680A] hover:bg-[linear-gradient(140deg,_#F4680A,_#FBAD38)] group">
                        <span class="bg-[linear-gradient(140deg,_#F4680A,_#FBAD38)] text-transparent bg-clip-text group-hover:text-white">
                            Contact Us
                        </span>
                    </a>
                </div>     
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-start">
                <Image src="/icons/arrow-design.webp" alt="arrow-icon" width={120} height={90} class="w-24" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</>